# Repository-wide safety net. Package-level rules live in backend/, FoodShareMobile/ and admin-dashboard/.

# --- Secrets / local configuration ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/firebase-service-account*.json
**/*service-account*.json

# --- Local upload fallback when S3 is not configured (documents and public images) ---
**/private_uploads/
backend/app/static/uploads/

# --- Thesis test evidence (contains DB snapshots with real personal data) ---
thesis_evidence/
**/db_before*.txt

# --- Generated caches ---
.pytest_cache/
backend/.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Personal / agent tooling (not part of the project source) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.agents/
.codex/
AGENTS.md
